  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/be3e6f32f31a9c665d4de7640fa322291259c54c8d18e7c613a2d463e3fa4f3c.png] \n\n \n \n\n \n \n**Code**\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Symbol**\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\nGiven : 11 - 2 × 4 ÷ 12 + 4\n\nOn replacing the codes: 11 × 2 - 4 + 12 ÷ 4\n\n→ 11 × 2 - 4 + __**12 **____**÷ 4**__\n\n→ __**11 ×**____** 2**__ - 4 + 3\n\n→ __**2**____**2**__ - 4 __**+ 3**__\n\n→ 25 - 4\n\n→ 21​\n\nHence, **21** is the correct answer.",
